name = pm_task_gate_error_code_push_to_read_only_user_stack_page_faults
mode = PM32
bytes = 8E D8
note = 80486 PRM 9.7.2 and 6.8.3: a task gate pushes the error code onto the stack of the new task at its CPL with no privilege level 0 override. The CPL 3 stack in a read-only user page with CR0.WP clear gives #PF with error code 07h. CR2 holds the push address, ESP keeps its value and the stack is not written. The #PF reaches its handler in the new task.

